{"a":[35,35],"h":"<p>35.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"235\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 234.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 39.0 45.8 68.3 78.8 85.6 85.6 94.6 94.6 102.0 117.8 122.3 129.8 129.8 145.6 145.6 152.3 160.6 167.3 167.3 167.3 174.0 180.8 180.8 196.6 203.3 210.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 45.8 68.3 94.6 122.3 152.3 174.0 203.3 210.0 218.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ona ise kötülüğü en güzel hasene ile def'etmek seciyyesine ancak sabredenler, sabrı huy edinenler irdirilir - çünkü nefsi intikam hissinden def'etmek ancak sabrı hakikî ile olur.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"237\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 236.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 32.3 32.3 42.7 60.7 60.7 60.7 74.3 95.3 103.6 103.6 120.0 124.6 132.0 132.0 147.7 147.7 154.6 162.7 169.6 169.6 169.6 176.3 183.0 183.0 198.7 205.6 212.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"42.7 74.3 124.6 154.6 176.3 205.6 212.3 220.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ve ona ancak azîm hazz sahibi irdirilir - kuvvei ruhiyye ve fezaili nefsiyyeden yüksek bir derece ile, ni'meti ilâhiyyeden büyük bir nasîbe mazher olmuş bahtiyar nâil olur. 36. </p>"}